<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-09T17:42:57.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:42:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Supreme Court rejected President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud's term extension, prompting armed forces to seize the court and threaten its chief. Somali security forces opened fire on protesters in Mogadishu, killing at least three civilians in clashes over home demolitions and two in separate police shootings. Government troops were attacked near Leego town, and the Somali police deputy chief warned of a security vacuum as Ugandan troops withdraw. Egypt, Somalia and Djibouti held talks on Red Sea security and Horn of Africa stability, and the conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNcG9kbGt6MzdyNnB0QUxremEzcVBqYTZsWlVYbVkxaVVPTnViQjIxcjN3ajZtelVXTkVwcGpHTkhIOXdLQkZGOVVRbUVZRTFYYmFOQnczT1l2RVRJRVNXblFzYUFMZDJxR3lsdXBlNllLS2huR2FYNFVtQ2hBUXVvdk5fUHFJVjdIRkdtOEc5RlVwaGU2S2pGNl84Yk9KSi0wdl9wLUc5a0tFVG9y?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Nation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE45ZVZQQ1BweDVLYVJjNUdVQ2hxWXMyQlhFYW9zeGM1N2FzUmNmQkNKc2xBT1p3VldiczVxQ251SzloYUdRQzdKdFk2a182UjZkX2w2clBQNUxNTDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;allAfrica.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPdVNoRm5kYzZhcWtKZEVxbUQ0eE1jLVZoMDFPeERaMEU0TlY3NGExeENEYU5zRGxuUVQzRXdZYUpjcDdwdGVzR05aLXNpSF94MUZCcnlFam5UQkhCaDlvNXBrbTc3RlR2blhPT214UkxMeUhJZ1VMTWJ4bW9DQm5CTU5mQW5CSDQzbVVmdVQxTExmbjhLcEtqTWZXN0pZazQzVmU5VDk5RXhhcnJVRlRaU2piLWYtN3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Polity.org.za&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOLWJzcDhMWEpKWHVnVm8yamIyVFNxcUJteTN0Z0pYVlZFOHhqYXAwU19XQmF4cEJIRTZ4LXZpUzVCYXJnRzh6djJXMm1ueWtXY